 entryName\\)#{1}":[99,109],"#SNMPResponse- Global#SNMPResponse - getOIDText\\(String name\\)":[110,121],"#SNMPResponse- Global#SNMPResponse - getOIDText\\(String name\\)#{1}":[112,121],"#SNMPResponse- Global#SNMPResponse - normalize\\(Object cur\\)":[122,136],"#SNMPResponse- Global#SNMPResponse - normalize\\(Object cur\\)#{1}":[124,136]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":28}],"metadata":{"title":"SNMPResponse - Global","description":"The SNMPResponse script include provides methods to wrap an SNMP payload response instance with methods to safely and easily retrieve SNMP singleton fields or tables.Builds an index to all SNMP entities in the current object.Builds references to actual instances for all identified indexes \\(in the discovery\\_snmp\\_ref table\\) that can be resolved.Returns an array of OIDs that match the given ref\\_base and which have a defined, non-null ref\\_leaf.Returns the integer contained in the OID object with the given MIB name.Retrieves the OID object with the given MIB name from the response.Returns a hashmap of table entries under the given parent MIB name, with the given entry MIB names.Returns the text contained in the OID object with the given MIB name.Resolves SNMP tables into hashmaps and OID values into primitives.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/c\\_SNMPResponseAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":2,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/c_SNMPResponseAPI.md"},
